{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"[operator-attested] Final round stocktake after Gerrit 1806. The APFS RAM-disk lever matched maintained OSS practice but failed rebar measurements and was fully reverted. Exact no-RAM control 31868300174: 17m26s default / 20m36s macOS job. Four treatments: 18m43.77s, 20m54.61s, 18m26s, and 20m00.60s default; every treatment was 5.5-20% slower, and recursive reporting/release added 71-98s. Change 1806 merged at 7d908fbbc6da12f8e274b3ef1e3a2357377799ef after run 31873067707 passed all jobs, macOS 24m42s, LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, zero unresolved comments. The experiment ticket unplayful-inaccurate-muskrat is closed with completion PASS.\n\nThe latest pre-experiment clean five-run distribution remains mean 31m28.8s / median 31m20s end-to-end, macOS job mean 27m56.2s, mean through macOS completion 30m13.4s, and final-vote queue mean 65.8s. That does not prove the 20-30m average objective. The merge restores the faster no-RAM path, but several organic post-merge full runs are required before recomputing the average; do not generate a control-only run.\n\nOpen disposition only: panpsychic-clever-hawk has 4/4 direction-level OSS consensus and projects about 75s macOS wall / 207 runner-seconds by removing per-test source-checkout Git subprocesses, but no fidelity-preserving implementation reaches consensus, so it remains pending operator choice. ravenous-beribboned-walleye is updated separately: the N=3000 node was 18.61s on exact no-RAM control and 19.85s on the final hosted macOS treatment, with Ubuntu 14.74-16.81s; its local 20.19-21.63s residual is dominated by 24 contractually required Git add/commit pairs and is not yet a proven safe remediation. Per operator direction, pause after this round rather than start another change."},"env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786783951863728001,"uuid":"72dee02c-faa7-48f9-a55b-c22d7371a43a"}